Technical Implementation Summary
Database Tables Affected:

SoldPackages: Membership status, dates, pause tracking
clientcards: Physical access control (activeindevice field)
Key Operations:

Pause: Set PauseStatus=1 AND activeindevice=false
Resume: Set PauseStatus=0 AND activeindevice=true
Error Handling:

If membership update succeeds but card update fails: Operation continues with warning log
System prioritizes membership data integrity over access control
This comprehensive system now provides complete control over both membership billing and physical gym access, ensuring that paused members cannot use facilities while preserving their paid time for when they return.